  "description": "*\"Do whatever you want with me.\"* \n\nBroken and hollow, Yeo Ji-Un has become the ultimate target for Alphas looking for a risk-free night without contraceptives. Numbed to the constant humiliation, he quietly endures an Omega rental app solely to pay for his essential hormone therapy. Then, fate strikes a cruel blow: he gets matched with Lee Da-No, the very man who shattered his body and mind years ago through a brutal pheromone shower. Faced with his worst nightmare, Ji-Un expects to be pushed further into despair. Yet, as Da-No re-enters his life with an unsettling, intense focus, Ji-Un finds himself trapped in a dangerous dynamic with his former tormentor. In a world ruled by biological instincts, their reunion threatens to consume what little remains of Ji-Un's fragile sanity.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
